WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:20.864
This is the Daily Karma. Today’s practice is yugen: more than is shown. Find a supported position. Let your eyes close, or rest gently on the painting.

2
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.313
Feel where your body meets the chair or floor. Soften your hands. Give gravity permission to carry a little more of your weight.

3
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:06.963
Feel the quiet rhythm of breathing. When the mind moves ahead, come back to one simple inhale and one unhurried exhale.

4
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:34.403
Yugen is the sense that there is more than what is being shown. Not a secret to be solved, but a depth felt at the edge of a thing without reaching its end.

5
00:01:51.000 --> 00:02:01.263
Mountains going back into mist, ridge behind ridge, until you cannot say how far it runs. The mist is not hiding the view. The mist is the view.

6
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:29.242
Notice what your body is doing with these words. Soften around the eyes, the hands, and the belly. Keep only the effort needed to stay present.

7
00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:56.684
Let attention go to the edge of what you can feel, where sensation turns vague. Stay there without trying to bring it into focus.

8
00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:25.009
I will leave some quiet here. You do not need to empty the mind. Notice what appears, release the story, and return to breathing.

9
00:03:55.000 --> 00:04:03.916
Still here. Still breathing. Nothing special needs to happen. This quiet awareness is already a useful way of meeting your life.

10
00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:25.870
Let one thing stay unexplained today. A mood you do not account for. A piece of music you do not analyse. Let it keep its depth.

11
00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:52.706
Take one fuller breath. Feel the space beyond your body and let your eyes open in their own time. Thank you for practicing with Karma.
